# RVHyno basic monitor

This projects implements a monitor for the formula
```
{{formula}}
```
(where the free quantifiers are assigned by the parent monitors).

This part of the project does not produce an executable, only a library that is used by the parent monitors.

## Modifying code

The code is in general generated by the `rvhyno.hnl.codegen.submonitors.atoms` package
and the templates are stored in `rvhyno/hnl/codegen/templates/atoms`.

For more information about the structure and modifications of the code, see `HACKING.md` in the top-level directory.
